08 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>危险的东北风暴引发美国东海岸停电</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/dangerous-nor-easter-storm-triggers-widespread-power-outages</link><description>感恩节当天，一场爆炸性风暴将皇后区的树木连根拔起，新泽西州的通勤铁路线被淹没，导致东海岸超过 50 万户家庭和企业断电。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/dangerous-nor-easter-storm-triggers-widespread-power-outages'&gt;危险的东北风暴引发美国东海岸停电&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Power Outages, Flood Risks Linger as Storm Leaves East Coast&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/dangerous-nor-easter-storm-triggers-widespread-power-outages</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 14:20:06 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>假期过后风险偏好回升 美股将反弹</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/us-stocks-set-to-bounce-as-risk-appetite-returns-after-holiday</link><description>美国股市有望反弹，纳斯达克 100 指数跌至熊市边缘后，风险偏好有所回升。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/us-stocks-set-to-bounce-as-risk-appetite-returns-after-holiday'&gt;假期过后风险偏好回升 美股将反弹&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：US Stocks Rebound as Traders Pile Into Battered Tech Shares&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/us-stocks-set-to-bounce-as-risk-appetite-returns-after-holiday</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 07:56:20 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>特朗普的人工智能策略推动了华尔街疯狂的感恩节周</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/trump-s-ai-gambit-fuels-wild-thanksgiving-week-on-wall-street</link><description>华盛顿本周发出的信息是明确无误的：美国必须不惜一切代价赢得与中国的人工智能竞赛，并且政府准备进行干预以实现这一目标。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/trump-s-ai-gambit-fuels-wild-thanksgiving-week-on-wall-street'&gt;特朗普的人工智能策略推动了华尔街疯狂的感恩节周&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Trump’s AI Gambit Fuels Wild Thanksgiving Week on Wall Street&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/trump-s-ai-gambit-fuels-wild-thanksgiving-week-on-wall-street</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 18:43:36 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>